### Session 02 · the three levels of "give me JSON", as raw HTTP
### Works in Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code REST Client.
### Set an environment variable GROQ_API_KEY before running.

@baseUrl = https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
@key = {{$processEnv GROQ_API_KEY}}

### Level 1 · just ask (no guarantee: fences, preambles, drift)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "Classify the support ticket and return JSON with category, priority and sentiment." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "UPI payment failed but the money was deducted from my bank account!!" }
  ]
}

### Level 2 · JSON mode (valid JSON guaranteed, shape NOT guaranteed; prompt must mention JSON)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  "temperature": 0.2,
  "response_format": { "type": "json_object" },
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "Classify the support ticket. Respond with ONLY a JSON object: {\"category\": \"Billing|Bug|HowTo|FeatureRequest|Cancellation\", \"priority\": \"Low|Medium|High\", \"sentiment\": \"Positive|Neutral|Negative\", \"oneLineSummary\": \"...\"}" },
    { "role": "user", "content": "UPI payment failed but the money was deducted from my bank account!!" }
  ]
}

### Level 3 · structured outputs (shape guaranteed by constrained decoding; strict needs a supporting model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/completions
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b",
  "reasoning_effort": "low",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "Classify the customer support ticket." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "UPI payment failed but the money was deducted from my bank account!!" }
  ],
  "response_format": {
    "type": "json_schema",
    "json_schema": {
      "name": "ticket_triage",
      "strict": true,
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "category":       { "type": "string", "enum": ["Billing", "Bug", "HowTo", "FeatureRequest", "Cancellation"] },
          "priority":       { "type": "string", "enum": ["Low", "Medium", "High"] },
          "sentiment":      { "type": "string", "enum": ["Positive", "Neutral", "Negative"] },
          "oneLineSummary": { "type": "string" }
        },
        "required": ["category", "priority", "sentiment", "oneLineSummary"],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    }
  }
}
